{
  "$description": "CommentMessage design preview tokens (stage 1). Decided by the Design System Lead on 2026-11-22 (B160): molecule, one size; header on one line (Avatar small + name label text.primary, ellipsis + date label-sm text.secondary, absolute date '19 Nov 2026, 14:43', '· Edited' after the date) then the text in body text.primary, wrapping with no limit; padding space.8, radius.8, gap header→text space.8; variant 'position' first / reply (reply: separator border.subtle above), variant 'author' other / me (me: background.subtle, other: no background); '…' IconButton (more_horiz) shown on hover / focus, its option list waits for a Menu component. Then: header gap space.8, separator border-width.1, IconButton tertiary, hover = state layer on the whole message + the '…' button, always shown on touch screens. The header is as tall as the IconButton (36px), which keeps its place when hidden. The hover state layer is painted over the whole message, content included (like Button and NavigationItem): text.secondary on background.subtle stays at 4.62:1 in hover (accepted by the Design System Lead, B160).",
  "text": "Could the primary button be full width on mobile?",
